name: sim.getRandom
description: Deprecated. use math.random2 and math.randomseed2 instead
luaSynopsis: float randomValue = sim.getRandom(int seed = None)
pythonSynopsis: float randomValue = sim.getRandom(int seed = nil)
inputs:
1. seed: an optional number that can be used to seed/reseed the random number generator. Leave empty or set to None/nil if the generator should not be reseeded.
outputs:
1. randomValue: a random number in the range of 0.0 and 1.0
